{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s05-credential-use-boundary.md -Raw; Write-Output \"=== ACCEPTANCE ===\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s05-acceptance.json -Raw'","aggregated_output":"# S05：模型/provider 覆盖选择的凭据使用约束（台账）\n\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：S05（TF-0280）。真实 provider 调用：无。\n\n## 链路（source → policy → effect）\n\n- 调用点：`openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/image-generate-tool.ts` —— **仅**在“显式 model/provider override”分支调用 `resolveProviderCredentialUsePolicy`（调用处 `hasExplicitModelOverride: true`）。\n- 策略：`openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/provider-credential-use-policy.ts`（`resolveProviderCredentialUsePolicy`）。\n- 语义：external / derived-untrusted / missing / invalid 来源 + 显式 override 时，请求的 provider 必须落在 **host 已配置/绑定的 image 生成 provider 范围**内；否则拒绝。策略输入里**没有**凭据值，凭据从不是该判定的输入。\n\n## 覆盖矩阵\n\n| 来源 | 显式 override | 请求 provider | 期望 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| trusted system / direct operator | 任意 | 任意 | 允许（既有语义不变） |\n| external/unknown | 无 | — | 允许（未显式 override，走默认/fallback，不经该闸门） |\n| external/unknown | 有 | 绑定范围内 | 允许 |\n| external/unknown | 有 | 绑定范围外 | **拒绝** |\n| external/unknown | 有 | 缺失 / 非法 | **拒绝** |\n\n拒绝发生在读取任何 provider 凭据之前；拒绝原因与凭据无关（只含 provider 范围说明）。\n\n## 残余（residual，显式记录，不冒充已覆盖）\n\n- 该闸门**只**接在 `image-generate-tool.ts` 的显式 override 分支；其它凭据使用路径（例如聊天模型 override、其它 provider 凭据消费方）**未**由本策略覆盖。\n- 调用处把 `hasExplicitModelOverride` 写死为 `true`（该分支本身就是显式 override），因此策略的“无 override 放行”分支在 image-generate 侧不由生产调用点触发，仅在单测覆盖。\n- 本台账只覆盖 image 生成的 provider override 选择；不覆盖密钥存储/轮换/泄露面。\n\n## 边界与不做项\n\n- 不新建第二套凭据策略；不改默认 provider、fallback 或凭据存储；不改产品默认值/锁/approval。\n- 非真人证据；无真实 provider 调用。\n\r\n=== ACCEPTANCE ===\r\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-13\",\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n  \"actor\": \"codex-s05-mainline-developer\",\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"task\": \"TF-0280\",\n    \"packet\": \"S05\",\n    \"title\": \"Provider credential-use boundary ledger (image override)\",\n    \"source\": \"policy unit verification + call-site pin (no live provider/credential)\",\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\n    \"realHuman\": false\n  },\n  \"decision\": {\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\n    \"reason\": \"Existing credential-use tests (15) pass; new ledger guard verifies the policy matrix and pins the single call site. Explicit provider override under external/unknown provenance is confined to the host-bound provider scope; no credential value is a policy input. Other credential users recorded as residual.\"\n  },\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"commit\": \"eda64ac3defe18e9c42de31d60e39722f40407e5\",\n    \"tree\": \"21be6728f3879681c8c1215ebc99336ed12df0f8\",\n    \"dirty\": false,\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-s05-credential-use-20261013\",\n    \"base\": \"ae9ea9162c105f734566f5a696d55b5eae5071df\",\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\27933\\\\.codex\\\\worktrees\\\\o02-main\\\\ClawX\",\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-13T13:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-13T13:05:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"credentialUseLedger\": {\n    \"policy\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/provider-credential-use-policy.ts#resolveProviderCredentialUsePolicy\",\n    \"callSite\": \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/tools/image-generate-tool.ts (explicit model-override path)\",\n    \"policyInputs\": [\n      \"provenanceContext\",\n      \"hasExplicitModelOverride\",\n      \"requestedProvider\",\n      \"boundProviderIds\"\n    ],\n    \"credentialValueInInput\": false,\n    \"matrix\": {\n      \"trusted\": \"allowed (any override)\",\n      \"no-explicit-override\": \"allowed (default/fallback path skips the gate)\",\n      \"external+override+in-scope\": \"allowed\",\n      \"external+override+out-of-scope\": \"denied\",\n      \"external+override+missing-or-invalid-provider\": \"d