{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_379","type":"agent_message","text":"All work is complete and verified. The change set is exactly the 7 files in the task's `targetScope`, with no collateral edits.\n\n**Summary**\n\nImplemented S06: runtime memory self-edit writes (`memory_update` / `memory_forget` / `memory_strengthen`) now record digest-only receipts through the **existing** RC-04 `EffectReceiptStore`, with per-intent idempotency and honest outcome mapping.\n\n**Changes**\n- Added `openclaw_runtime/src/runtime-core/memory-effect-receipt.ts` — digest-only receipt builder + fail-open `recordMemoryEffect`; imports the store only behind a structural `MemoryEffectReceiptSink` type, so runtime-core never imports `agents/` at runtime.\n- Wired `openclaw_runtime/src/runtime-core/memory-self-edit-tools.ts` at each write decision point: `applied` on success, `not_applied` before any effect, `unknown` after partial effect (fact appended but invalidation/relation failed), never disguised as applied.\n- Added the sealed unit test, the task spec, the S06 ledger, the acceptance record, and `S06-SHA256SUMS`.\n\n**Contract**\n- Idempotency key `memory-effect:v1:<sha256(action⋮factId⋮sessionKey⋮runId⋮toolCallId)>` is outcome-independent, so replaying an intent is an identical-content duplicate with 0 duplicate effects.\n- Proposal carries only `domain/action/factId(/newFactId)` — no memory content; actor/effect go in `stage1Context`.\n- No second effect store or migration; product locks/defaults unchanged.\n\n**Checks run (all reproducible, dependency reuse via hidden junctions, no install/network)**\n- Sealed oracle: `memory-effect-receipt.test.ts` + `apply-patch-effect-receipt.test.ts` + `stage1-effect-receipt.test.ts` → 3 files, 24 tests, 0 failed.\n- Memory suite `src/memory` + sealed test → 3 files, 67 tests, 0 failed.\n- Scoped `oxlint` on the touched files → 0.\n- `pnpm harness validate` (real diff) → valid; `pnpm harness run --dry-run` → pass (run in a scratch git projection since the trial snapshot has no `.git`).\n- `pnpm run comms:replay` / `comms:compare` → 0, all gated metrics PASS at 0.00% delta.\n- Credential scan on the 6 retained files → 0 hits; `S06-SHA256SUMS` reads back 6/6.\n- `pnpm run tsgo:core` → exit 2, but only pre-existing red in untouched files (`ui/vitest.config.ts`, `shared/types/*`); no error in the changed files.\n\nStructured result:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"completed\",\n  \"summary\": \"S06: memory self-edit writes (memory_update/forget/strengthen) now record digest-only effect receipts through the existing RC-04 EffectReceiptStore. Per-intent idempotency key (action+factId+sessionKey+runId+toolCallId, outcome-independent) makes replays identical-content duplicates (0 duplicate effects); outcomes map to applied/not_applied/unknown without disguising unknown as applied; sink failures are fail-open and never block the write. No second effect store, no migration, no product-lock change. Sealed oracle (3 files/24 tests) and memory suite (67 tests) pass; scoped lint 0; harness validate (real diff) + dry-run pass; comms replay/compare 0.00% delta all PASS; credential scan 0 hits; S06-SHA256SUMS reads back 6/6. Only tsgo:core is red, on the pre-existing baseline in untouched files.\",\n  \"testsRun\": [\n    \"pnpm exec node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run src/runtime-core/memory-effect-receipt.test.ts src/agents/apply-patch-effect-receipt.test.ts src/agents/stage1-effect-receipt.test.ts --maxWorkers=1  (3 files, 24 tests, 0 failed)\",\n    \"pnpm exec node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run src/memory src/runtime-core/memory-effect-receipt.test.ts --maxWorkers=1  (3 files, 67 tests, 0 failed)\",\n    \"pnpm exec oxlint src/runtime-core/memory-effect-receipt.ts src/runtime-core/memory-self-edit-tools.ts src/runtime-core/memory-effect-receipt.test.ts  (exit 0)\",\n    \"pnpm harness validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-memory-effect-receipt.md  (Spec is valid)\",\n    \"pnpm harness run --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-memory-effect-receipt.md --dry-run  (pass)\",\n    \"pnpm run comms:replay  (exit 0)\",\n    \"pnpm run comms:compare  (all PASS, 0.00% delta)\",\n    \"pnpm run tsgo:core  (exit 2; pre-existing baseline red in untouched ui/ and shared/types files only)\"\n  ]\n}\n```"}}
